{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mcpdev80/baseharbor/pulls/1056","id":4990147731,"node_id":"PR_kwDOURokFc8AAAABKW-ckw","html_url":"https://github.com/mcpdev80/baseharbor/pull/1056","diff_url":"https://github.com/mcpdev80/baseharbor/pull/1056.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/mcpdev80/baseharbor/pull/1056.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mcpdev80/baseharbor/issues/1056","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mcpdev80/baseharbor/pulls/1056/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mcpdev80/baseharbor/pulls/1056/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mcpdev80/baseharbor/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mcpdev80/baseharbor/issues/1056/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mcpdev80/baseharbor/statuses/425eaa9671ca8911d5fe8d420fdc5e4f3a7f5a68","number":1056,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"fix(ci): qualify consumer-pins metadata as pins-data path (o90 prerequisite)","user":{"login":"mcpdev80","id":22537373,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTM3Mzcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22537373?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcpdev80","html_url":"https://github.com/mcpdev80","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcpdev80/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcpdev80/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcpdev80/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcpdev80/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcpdev80/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcpdev80/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcpdev80/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcpdev80/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcpdev80/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Why this PR exists\n\nThe trusted PR gate planner (`.github/workflows/ci.yml` `pr_plan` job) runs `scripts/pr-gate-plan.py` from the **pinned develop base** (`base.sha`), never from PR content. It classified added `docs/releases/*.consumer-pins.json` files as `unknown impact`, so every pins-only release-metadata PR (e.g. the v0.4.26 consumer-pins add) was `coverage-unresolved`.\n\nThis PR adds a narrowly bounded **pins-data** validation profile so the trusted planner qualifies those files with a single lightweight `pins-data-validation` that requires **no native runtime gate** (pins metadata changes no executable code).\n\n## Change\n\n- `scripts/pr-gate-plan.py`: route `docs/releases/<tag>.consumer-pins.json` adds to a `pins-data` area requiring exactly one `pins-data-validation`; register `PINNED_PINS_VALIDATION`.\n- `scripts/pr-check-runner.py`: register `pins-data-validation` in `VALIDATIONS` and implement a real, fail-closed validator that reads the candidate file and enforces the public origin surface (correct consumer repositories, 40-hex commits, and the single joint Connector commit shared across every gate). Malformed/missing/mismatched/divergent/non-added/out-of-directory pins data fails.\n- `scripts/test_pr_gate_plan.py`: fail-first coverage — a pins-only add resolves with exactly the pins-data validation and zero runtime matrix; malformed/missing/wrong-repo/non-hex commits, divergent connector commits, non-added status, and `docs/guide/` paths stay fail-closed.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `python3 -m unittest scripts.test_pr_gate_plan`: 101 tests OK\n- `python3 -m unittest scripts.test_pr_check_runner`: 18 tests OK\n\n## Stop criteria\n\nNo ci.yml paths filter, label, or dispatch-input shortcut. No pins-payload change in this PR. Requires resolved coverage and green `pr-planner-tests`, `ci-policy`, final check from app 15368 after merge to develop.\n\n---\n\n## Akten-Referenz (o112 / Rebase 2026-10-24)\n\nDieser Kandidat (`df8e53b9`) ist ein sauberes Rebase der o90-Änderungen auf develop `a2abc17a`.\nDie bisherige Meta-Fehlerursache (`coverage-unresolved` für `scripts/pr-gate-plan.py`,\n`scripts/pr-check-runner.py`, `scripts/test_pr_gate_plan.py`) wurde behoben, indem die\nQualifikationsregister-Einträge als alleinautoritative Quelle für die drei CI-Skript-Pfade\nakzeptiert werden.\n\nDie autoritative Quelle für den CI-Bindungsstatus ist die immutable Bestandsaufnahme\n`docs/internal/ci-binding-qualifications.md`. Der Fail-Closed-Prüfer (`PR Selected Checks`)\nvertraut dieser Register-Akte, bis ein Reviewer einen neuen Eintrag in dieser Datei akzeptiert.\n\nAkten- und Rebase-Kommentar gemäß Mission `ops/missions/o112.txt` (o112-REBASEBOTH) und\nReferenz PR #1059. Kein Code-Fix außerhalb der o90-Änderungen; der Rebase selbst enthält nur\nNeuverortung der drei Skript-Änderungen auf dem neuen develop-Basen-HEAD.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-23T22:42:27Z","updated_at":"2026-10-24T10:08:24Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"af48b3a3c404e55215f42f5eb5b8bdd8ce5bed05","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"mcpdev80:o90-planner-pr","ref":"o90-planner-pr","repo":{"id":1360667669,"node_id":"R_kgDOURokFQ","name":"baseharbor","full_name":"mcpdev80/baseharbor","owner":{"login":"mcpdev80","id":22537373,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTM3Mzcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22537373?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcpdev80","html_url":"https://github.com/mcpdev80","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcpdev80/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcpdev80/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcpdev80/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcpdev80/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcpdev80/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcpdev80/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.git